// Pistol damage against the height of the aim point: ten shots at 600 uu, the aim point from the
// guard's knees to above its head. The original's head region is a bone (physics-asset body) lookup
// (DisBullet 0x00C29820 -> 0x00B66A50 region byte == DHR_HEAD); the port's is z > centre + 0.6 x
// half height (left_hand::step_projectiles). The sweep gives the boundary on both sides.
// Dispersion 15 px adds up to +-11 uu at this distance, so a boundary is a band, not a line.
